    {
      "title": "multilingual-e5-small: Text-to-Text model — overview, use cases ...",
      "url": "https://www.aimodels.fyi/models/huggingFace/multilingual-e5-small-intfloat",
      "snippet": "Overview multilingual-e5-small is a compact multilingual embedding model maintained by intfloat that generates 384-dimensional sentence embeddings for 100 languages. The model contains 12 layers initialized from Microsoft&#x27;s Multilingual-MiniLM-L12-H384 and trained through two stages: contrastive pre-training on 5.97 billion weakly-supervised text pairs (from mC4, CC News, NLLB translations ..."
    },
    {
      "title": "multilingual-e5-small by intfloat, Sentence Similarity | Mixpeek Model Hub",
      "url": "https://mixpeek.com/model/intfloat/multilingual-e5-small",
      "snippet": "Overview multilingual-e5-small is a small, fast text embedding model covering 100+ languages. Like the rest of the E5 family it uses instruction prefixes, &#x27;query:&#x27; for searches and &#x27;passage,&#x27; for indexed documents, which meaningfully improves retrieval quality for its size. It is a strong, cheap default for multilingual semantic search."
    }
